# Keep the build context small and never ship secrets or local media.
# NOTE: patterns are anchored on purpose — `**/storage` would also drop apps/api/src/storage (source code).
**/node_modules
apps/*/dist
packages/*/dist
apps/api/storage
/storage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
# Docs/deploy files that the image doesn't need (editing them won't invalidate the build cache).
README.md
docs
docker-compose*.yml
deploy/Caddyfile
